@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@token = REPLACE_WITH_ACTOR_BEARER_TOKEN
@tripId = REPLACE_WITH_TRIP_UUID

### Recipient navigation (after accepting invitation)
GET {{baseUrl}}/trips/{{tripId}}/navigation-context
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Linked participant history
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/public-trip-participations/history?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Existing buyer history — separate meaning
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/public-trips/history?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
